1
00:04:23,478 --> 00:04:29,478
War leaves scars. Heroes leave legends.

2
00:08:46,956 --> 00:08:52,956
Before Dawn is a war, drama, history film directed by Jordon Prince-Wright.

3
00:13:10,434 --> 00:13:16,434
After leaving his family's sheep farm in the Australian outback, a young man joins his countrymen on the
western front of World War I with hopes of helping expedite an end to the bloody conflict.

4
00:17:33,913 --> 00:17:39,913
But as war rages on, he is forced to grapple with the brutal realities of trench warfare, including
a near-constant battle to keep himself alive—without leaving another man behind.

5
00:21:57,391 --> 00:22:03,391
Inspired by the real-life diary entries of local ANZACs, the feature film details
the untold story of some of Australia’s greatest military victories.

6
00:26:20,869 --> 00:26:26,869
Jim Collins, played by Levi Miller.

7
00:30:44,347 --> 00:30:50,347
Thomas Nickels, played by Travis Jeffery.

8
00:35:07,826 --> 00:35:13,826
Don, played by Ed Oxenbould.

9
00:39:31,304 --> 00:39:37,304
Cpl Beale, played by Stephen Peacocke.

10
00:43:54,782 --> 00:44:00,782
Sgt Beaufort, played by Myles Pollard.

11
00:48:18,260 --> 00:48:24,260
Big Tooth, played by Tim Franklin.

12
00:52:41,739 --> 00:52:47,739
Until Dawn is a 2025 American survival horror film adapted from the 2015 video game by PlayStation Studios, and it is set
in the same universe while featuring an original standalone story that expands upon the game's mythology.

13
00:57:05,217 --> 00:57:11,217
The film was directed by David F.

14
01:01:28,695 --> 01:01:34,695
Sandberg, and written by Gary Dauberman and Blair Butler.

15
01:05:52,173 --> 01:05:58,173
It stars Ella Rubin, Michael Cimino, Odessa A'zion, Ji-young Yoo, and Belmont Cameli as a group of friends who end up in a secluded area embedded with a time loop
mechanic; a threat is out to hunt them where dying restarts the night with a new threat each time, and the only solution is to survive until morning.

16
01:10:15,652 --> 01:10:21,652
Peter Stormare also stars, reprising his role from the game.

17
01:14:39,130 --> 01:14:45,130
In January 2024, Sony Pictures announced the film's development with
Screen Gems and PlayStation Productions set to produce.

18
01:19:02,608 --> 01:19:08,608
Casting announcements were made throughout 2024 and principal photography
took place between August and October 2024 in Budapest.

19
01:23:26,086 --> 01:23:32,086
The crew features frequent collaborators of Sandberg, including composer Benjamin
Wallfisch, cinematographer Maxime Alexandre, and editor Michel Aller.

20
01:27:49,565 --> 01:27:55,565
Until Dawn was released in the United States by Sony
Pictures Releasing on April 25, 2025.

21
01:32:13,043 --> 01:32:19,043
The film received mixed reviews from critics and grossed $54 million worldwide.

22
01:36:36,521 --> 01:36:42,521
The tone is dark and emotional.
